From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:11:12 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: spoof Neo battery status with native bindings
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Expose the secure Window-only Battery Status API for the Chrome 155
MacBook Neo persona. Report a plugged-in, fully charged laptop:
charging=true, chargingTime=0, dischargingTime=Infinity, level=1.
Do not query host power state or simulate battery changes.

Use a native EventTarget-derived BatteryManager with read-only accessors
and four EventHandler attributes. Keep its wrapper in the Navigator's
creation realm. Cache the pending getBattery Promise on the Navigator
wrapper before resolution can read a user-defined then getter; resolve
without draining unrelated microtasks mid-call.

Own event listeners on the BatteryManager so borrowed setters/methods
and retained objects do not depend on a live originating Frame. Register
stable native attribute listeners to preserve listener order across
callback replacement, support cancellation and exception reporting, and
retain non-callable objects per EventHandler conversion. Mark events as
at-target while dispatching to reject same-event recursive dispatch, then
clear transient dispatch/propagation state so events can be reused.

Hide both the Navigator operation and global interface in insecure
contexts. Save native entries while hidden and restore their descriptors
if the reused popup context becomes secure after a redirect; release
saved handles on context teardown. Worker API lists omit BatteryManager
and the operation is Window-only.

Update the existing Navigator getBattery case for the new contract,
including reentrant identity, handler behavior and event dispatch state.
Add no test cases. Attribute the new implementation to Brenno Flávio
<contato@brennoflavio.com.br> while retaining the AGPL license block.

References:
https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/33b3fb5573761f547826bdff366260dc9b5e76d2/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/battery/battery_manager.idl
https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/33b3fb5573761f547826bdff366260dc9b5e76d2/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/battery/navigator_battery.idl
https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/33b3fb5573761f547826bdff366260dc9b5e76d2/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/battery/battery_manager.cc
